# The Specular Discord server: the toolbar button, its Settings name, the palette and About.
# machine-drafted, needs native review

toolbar-discord = Word lid van de { -app-name }-Discord
toolbar-discord-help = De Discord-server van { -app-name } in de browser openen.
settings-viewing-toolbar-items-discord = { -app-name } op Discord

# The other apps by the same people: About names them, and "Get …" opens an app's page in
# the browser. Pagebara, Dozed and Amazynk are names and stay as they are.
# machine-drafted, needs native review

about-more-apps = Meer van Amazynk
about-more-apps-pagebara = Pagebara: een snelle, private pdf-viewer en -editor. Voor Linux, Windows en macOS.
about-more-apps-dozed = Dozed: bevriest de Linux-desktopapps waar je niet naar kijkt, zodat ze de CPU niet meer wekken.
palette-get-pagebara = Pagebara downloaden
palette-get-pagebara-help = De pagina van Pagebara, een pdf-viewer en -editor, in de browser openen. Daar staan de downloads.
palette-get-dozed = Dozed downloaden
palette-get-dozed-help = De pagina van Dozed, dat achtergrondapps op Linux bevriest, in de browser openen. Daar staan de downloads.

# Settings › More from Amazynk: a row for each app, named for it, with the same button.
